### Phase 3 — moderation retry tuning + manual review
### Expected statuses are noted on every request.
###
### How to force a post into MANUAL_REVIEW quickly:
###   MODERATION_MAX_ATTEMPTS=1
###   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=wrong-key-please-fail
###   MODERATION_BACKOFF_MINUTES=1
###   MODERATION_JOB_DELAY_MS=5000
### Create a post as a student, then wait for the retry job. The first real
### failure moves it to MANUAL_REVIEW because max attempts is 1.
###
### @token       = student access token (owner of the post)
### @adminToken  = MODERATOR or SUPER_ADMIN access token
### @postId      = a post currently in MANUAL_REVIEW

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-user-access-token-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-access-token-here
@postId = 1

### 1. Owner sees the MANUAL_REVIEW post in "my posts"  -> 200, status MANUAL_REVIEW
GET {{host}}/api/posts/mine?status=MANUAL_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Owner opens the MANUAL_REVIEW post detail  -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Another student opens the same detail  -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherUserToken}}

### 4. Another student tries to save it  -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/saved-posts/toggle/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherUserToken}}

### 5. Another student tries to report it  -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{otherUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": {{postId}},
  "reason": "SCAM",
  "comment": "Manual-review posts cannot be reported."
}

### 6. Owner tries to mark it sold  -> 400 (only APPROVED can be sold)
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/sold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Owner edits it  -> 200, status PENDING_REVIEW, attempts reset to 0
###    (This removes it from the admin manual-review queue.)
PATCH {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="post"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated manual-review listing",
  "description": "Edited so the AI should review it again.",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "price": 250.00,
  "condition": "GOOD",
  "removeImageIds": []
}
--WebAppBoundary--

### 8. Admin queue, oldest first  -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/queue?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Admin full detail for the post  -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Admin approves it  -> 200, status APPROVED (or HIDDEN/USER_BLOCKED)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{postId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Checked manually; listing is allowed."
}

### 11. Approving the same post again  -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{postId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Duplicate action."
}

### 12. Admin rejects a different MANUAL_REVIEW post  -> 200, status REJECTED
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{otherPostId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Prohibited item under marketplace rules."
}

### 13. Reject with a too-short reason  -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{otherPostId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "bad"
}

### 14. Admin requeues a MANUAL_REVIEW post  -> 200, back to PENDING_REVIEW (attempts 0)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{otherPostId}}/requeue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "OpenRouter quota has reset; try the AI again."
}

### 15. Requeueing a post no longer in manual review  -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/{{otherPostId}}/requeue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Should conflict now."
}

### 16. User token on an admin route  -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. No token on an admin route  -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/moderation/queue
